        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Contemporary 16 Inch Octagon Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese bold 16 inch pulls for refrigerator doors, entry doors, commercial doors,  shower doors, are available as back to back or thru-bolt mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>This Octagon Door Pull is available in other sizes and finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nImpeccably crafted from high grade 3/8\" thick 1-1/4\" wide aluminum in your choice of 6 high quality, long lasting finish choices.\r\n</P>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> of First Impressions Octagon Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 15\" Center to Center</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>",
